  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 716.04 Sludge Grinder Pumps",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 716.04 Sludge Grinder Pumps.\n\n(a) Sludge grinder pumps shall be installed prior to sludge processing equipment that would be adversely affected by large solids.\n\n(b) Grinders shall be installed on the suction side of the pump to prevent clogging.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Wq 700) #8590, eff 3-25-06; ss by #10693, eff 10-15-14; ss by #14258, eff 7-1-25, EXPIRES: 7-1-35",
